(6837854, 1029034, 138253, '<td valign="top">great detail and contrasting color on the salamander, but the image feels a bit crowded, especially given the title.<br/>not sure if this is a terrarium or in the wild - understandable if it''s wild you don''t have control over the settings as well to photograph something like this.</td>', 'great detail and contrasting color on the salamander, but the image feels a bit crowded, especially given the title.not sure if this is a terrarium or in the wild - understandable if it''s wild you don''t have control over the settings as well to photograph something like this.', '2012-08-08 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6837855, 1029070, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. The things photographers do to make a child smile.</td>', 'This is excellent. The things photographers do to make a child smile.', '2012-08-08 11:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6837856, 1028781, 138253, '<td valign="top">Hopefully when i look as "wizened" as this guy i''ll have even 1/2 of that much hair left of my head ;)</td>', 'Hopefully when i look as "wizened" as this guy i''ll have even 1/2 of that much hair left of my head ;)', '2012-08-08 11:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6837858, 1029027, 138253, '<td valign="top">damn i hate being stung by jellyfish.... at least the ones where i grew up were some of the less poisonous types, that never really made you feel better when you got stung though.</td>', 'damn i hate being stung by jellyfish.... at least the ones where i grew up were some of the less poisonous types, that never really made you feel better when you got stung though.', '2012-08-08 11:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
