(6838992, 1029066, 96815, '<td valign="top">The stitches look weeeird, as if they don''t share the same reality as the model (aka photoshopped in) Other than that everything is top notch. Tied for my top vote.</td>', 'The stitches look weeeird, as if they don''t share the same reality as the model (aka photoshopped in) Other than that everything is top notch. Tied for my top vote.', '2012-08-10 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
