(6841730, 1029032, 112828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave you a 5, great statue, but to me that''s all it is a statue, should of gone for the mad hatter instead ~ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Street performer, not a statue. :)  A rather good street performer apparently. lol!</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: I gave you a 5, great statue, but to me that''s all it is a statue, should of gone for the mad hatter instead ~   Street performer, not a statue. :)  A rather good street performer apparently. lol!', '2012-08-15 03:29:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6841731, 1029066, 41337, '<td valign="top">Until I read these comments I was completely unaware that attractive people were immortal. Good news for both you and me! :P In all seriousness, if I had one critique it would be that while your photo clearly conveyed the quiet concept it only did so superficially. I personally would have enjoyed it more had the concept been supported in more aspects of the picture making process. For example, your composition fills the frame with detail and the light is fairly bright. As a picture, independent of the concept, it''s loud, not quiet. Had it been a more minimal composition with say a dim light source in the distance it would have quieted down the shot considerably. If that makes sense.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-08-15 02:33:18.</i></td>', 'Until I read these comments I was completely unaware that attractive people were immortal. Good news for both you and me! :P In all seriousness, if I had one critique it would be that while your photo clearly conveyed the quiet concept it only did so superficially. I personally would have enjoyed it more had the concept been supported in more aspects of the picture making process. For example, your composition fills the frame with detail and the light is fairly bright. As a picture, independent of the concept, it''s loud, not quiet. Had it been a more minimal composition with say a dim light source in the distance it would have quieted down the shot considerably. If that makes sense.', '2012-08-15 03:31:24.000000', '2012-08-15 03:33:18.000000', 0),
(6841732, 1029066, 41337, '<td valign="top">double post<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-08-15 02:31:43.</i></td>', 'double post', '2012-08-15 03:31:24.000000', '2012-08-15 03:31:43.000000', 0),
