(6935773, 1028667, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely, well-detailed capture of the lamb on the run. I really like the way the positions of his legs are shown - almost seem to be tangled. I''m not sure if he is running along the top of a ridge or if that impression comes from the dof. Either way, it is a great combination of foreground and background.</td>', 'Lovely, well-detailed capture of the lamb on the run. I really like the way the positions of his legs are shown - almost seem to be tangled. I''m not sure if he is running along the top of a ridge or if that impression comes from the dof. Either way, it is a great combination of foreground and background.', '2012-12-17 20:07:10.000000', NULL, 0),
